orite folders in the FileSystem dock currently act only as shortcuts. Their contents cannot be accessed directly from Favorites, which makes navigating between distant folders and moving files between them unnecessarily difficult.\r\n\r\nThis implements the improvement proposed in:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14775\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Show the complete recursive contents of favorite folders directly in the Favorites tree.\r\n- Show files inside favorite folders, including in split and tree-only display modes.\r\n- Preserve expansion state for favorite folders independently from the corresponding folders in the main FileSystem tree.\r\n- Allow files and folders inside favorite folders to be used as regular drag-and-drop items.\r\n- Allow files and folders to be moved or copied into favorite folders by dropping them onto the folder.\r\n- Preserve reordering of top-level favorite entries.\r\n- Preserve support for individual favorite files.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0c877f8e-5ebe-43d7-8c0d-98894f1c20c3\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14775*\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues a